  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Draw command (code 1). Shows the label DRAW and waits for the button to go up. While the button is up, the start of the line follows the cursor. While the button is down, draws a line with the brush from the last point to the cursor ($2788), and the cursor becomes the last point. A move of 25 pixels or more on one axis changes the last point and draws nothing. A long press off the pad goes to tool_exit."},
    {"at":17,"placement":"side","text":"button_press_edge = button_held."},
